  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird HE-VAN-15 is an adjustable spray nozzle for precise watering of lawns, borders and flower beds. The nozzle produces a fan-shaped spray and allows the installer to set the watering arc to suit the shape of the area. The stated radius is 3.4–4.6 m, the available arc is 0–360°, and the recommended operating pressure is 1.0–2.1 bar.

The VAN range is suitable for smaller zones and close-range watering. HE-VAN models are designed for improved application efficiency when used at the correct pressure and with a suitable layout. The radius can be fine-tuned using the adjustment screw. Always select a nozzle that matches the sprinkler body, required coverage and flow available to the zone.

Compatible with suitable Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 series spray bodies. Actual radius can vary with pressure, nozzle setting and site conditions.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>High-efficiency, even fan-spray coverage</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Rain Bird HE-VAN-15</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p1s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> is a high-efficiency adjustable fan-spray nozzle for lawns and landscaped areas with varied shapes. Its spray profile provides more even distribution and improved close-in watering around the spray body, helping reduce dry areas near the head.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Technical specifications of HE-VAN-15</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Technical data: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p2s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>radius 15-ft class, up to 4.6 m; adjustable arc 0°–360°; operating pressure 1.0–2.1 bar, optimum 2.1 bar. Average lower-quarter distribution uniformity (DULQ) is about 70%, more than 40% higher than typical variable-arc spray nozzles.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Spray pattern and radius adjustment</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Adjustment: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p3s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>set the arc by turning the centre collar; a tactile click helps keep the setting in place. The stainless-steel screw adjusts flow and can reduce radius by up to 25%, while the supplied filter screen helps protect the nozzle from debris.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Compatibility with other nozzle families</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-p4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>HE-VAN fits Rain Bird 1800 spray heads, UNI-Spray heads and shrub adapters. Its matched precipitation rate allows properly designed zones to combine HE-VAN with Rain Bird MPR and U-Series nozzles.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>63289ec9-c0dd-4f13-ae4d-1f7f00a442c6-en-h5</_key>
